title: Intro
color: green
position: -200,200
---
<<fade_in SceneLoader>>
(Ugh, where am I?)                                                                                                 (Press space to continue.)
(Must've fallen asleep grading papers again...)
<<declare $grumpVisited = false>>
<<jump Controls>>
===

title: Controls
---
Welcome to your new job!
Tip 1: Press P to pause/unpause the game.
Tip 2: Use WASD or arrow keys to move, and mouse to look around.
===

title: WarmWelcome
color: blue
position: 0,0
when: once
---
Grump: Oh, it's you. Can you do me a favor?
Casey: Sorry, I need to get to class.
Grump: Ah, right. Get on with it then.
<<set $grumpVisited to true>>
===

title: Gossip
color: blue
position: 200,200
when: once
---
Tweety: Can you believe it? Looks like she's playing hooky again. 
Pierrot: I would be shocked if she graduates.
Tweety: Seriously. Such a truant should not walk with the rest of the students.
Pierrot: Agreed. Aren't you concerned, Miss Casey?
-> Casey: She's improving.
    Tweety: If I were you, I'd be more concerned. I mean, I take my reputation seriously as a teacher.
    Pierrot: Clearly, not everyone does.
-> Casey: Yes, I am.
    Tweety: That would be prudent.
Tweety: As much as I'd love to loiter with you, I'm quite busy. 
Tweety: Shouldn't you be off too, Miss Casey?
===
title: Gossip
color: blue
position: 400,200
when: always
---
Tweety: Shouldn't you be off to homeroom period, Miss Casey?
===

// Homeroom Scene

title:AfterHomeroom
---
<<fade_in SceneLoader>>
Casey: Annnd Tom, I saw you earlier. Alright everyone, go to class.
Sam: Sorry I was late again, Miss Casey.
Casey: You've been late a lot recently, Sam. Is everything okay? Don't you live next door?
Sam: Yeah, I'm a really slow walker.
Casey: Careful, one more tardy and I'll have to call your parents. Neither of us would be thrilled about that.
Sam: Yes, Miss Casey.
Casey: Alright, Sam. I won't hold you any longer.
<<pan_camera CutsceneCam 90 0>>
<<move_to Sam 5.8 1 -6.35 true>>
<<move_to Sam 9 1 2.3>>
<<disable_character Sam>>
<<pan_camera CutsceneCam -90 0>>
<<if $grumpVisited == true>>
    Casey: (I think that old grump wanted me to help him with something. I should go check.)
    <<else>>
    Casey: (Gerry looked preoccupied. I should see if he needs anything.)
<<endif>>
<<resume_player_movement Player 2>>
<<activate_player_camera CameraHolder>> 
===

title:GrumpyRequest
when: once
---
<<if $grumpVisited == true>>
    Casey: Hey Gerry, what were you asking before?
    <<else>>
    Casey: Hey Gerry, you alright?
<<endif>>
Grump: Oh...yes. Can you see to those file cabinets in the teacher's lounge, they are an absolute mess. Please organize them.
Casey: Sure thing.
===
title:GrumpyRequest
when: always
---
Grump: Time waits for no one.
Grump: Neither will those file cabinets in the teacher's lounge. Get to it!
===